    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A small round buckler stamped from sheet steel and laced to a leather forearm cuff. Faction-pressed in batches of a thousand and handed out to whoever could close their fingers around the grip. Half ward, half noisemaker \u2014 the dent in the front is where someone else's mistake stopped.</p><p><strong>Standard Issue.</strong> Pairs with any one-handed weapon. No signature, no attunement, no apologies for the dent.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Armor:</strong> Shield</li>\n  <li><strong>Defense:</strong> Guard +1</li>\n  <li><strong>Requires:</strong> Warding (trained)</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> I</li>\n  <li><strong>Cost:</strong> 50 Economy marks</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->",
